  "summary_en": "Iraq's 2025 national AI policy, drafted by a supreme committee under the Prime Minister. It sets a vision, goals and six pillars (capacity building, R&D and entrepreneurship, data and infrastructure, sectoral adoption, international cooperation, enabling environment including an AI ethics charter), plus governance bodies and monitoring indicators. It has no robotics content.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Six pillars: capacity building, R&D/entrepreneurship, quality data and infrastructure, sectoral adoption, regional/international cooperation, enabling environment",
   "Calls for a national AI ethics charter covering accountability, transparency, non-bias and privacy",
   "Human oversight stressed: full responsibility rests on human operators, not the machine",
   "Creates governance via the Supreme Council for AI and a National AI Center, with annual review",
   "Proposes monitoring indicators and incentives such as tax exemptions and venture funds"
